            </div>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80 mb-4 italic">
              "James was professional, friendly, courteous, diligent and the best at his business. You definitely feel comfortable having them in your space. They did a great job. Everything looked amazing. Highly recommend."
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-dark">Property Manager, Mesa</p>
